<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AGCO lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AGCO lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston said on Thursday it lowered its rating on the shares of AGCO Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock dropped off 1-5/16 at 32-5/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
